---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Remove registry credentials

Usage: specforge logout [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --registry <REGISTRY>
          Registry alias (defaults to the default registry)

      --path <PATH>
          The project whose specforge.json names the default registry (when --registry is not given)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
